  (0.0415, -0.003, 0) with a "right_" prefix (see simulate/src/robot_compose.h), so the
  names below become right_hand_thumb_0_joint etc., as in g1_29dof_with_hand.urdf.
  Motors (DDS order of rt/dex3/right/cmd): thumb_0 thumb_1 thumb_2 middle_0 middle_1 index_0 index_1.
  Torque actuators; the PD law of the real hand is evaluated by the dex3_hand bridge component.
  Tactile areas hand_press_0..8 = DDS press_sensor_state[0..8] (touch sensors on the inner side of the
  links, thumb 1/2, middle 0/1, index 0/1; the layout is a guess, see readme.md). -->
